{
 "name": "params-submit-turn-cwd-type-tools",
 "about": "submit_turn 带非字符串 workspaceCwd（数字 5、true、对象）时模型依次调 bash（相对路径写文件）、read_file、write_file（绝对路径）、glob。基线每个工具都在构造工具上下文时失败：sidecarToolContext.ts:124 的 buildTurnEnvironment 先 path.resolve(config.cwd)（TurnEnvironment.ts:15），抛 ERR_INVALID_ARG_TYPE「The \"paths[0]\" argument must be of type string. Received …」，工具结果是 TOOL_ERROR[tool_execution_failed][<工具>][environment_issue]，不弹权限询问，没有任何文件被写出（proj 下只有初始的 seed.txt）；模型答完后这一轮照 params-submit-turn-cwd-type 的路径以 turn_failed / agent_invalid_state 结束。",
 "files": {
  "proj/seed.txt": "seed line\n"
 },
 "provider": [
  {
   "name": "title",
   "when": [
    "Generate a concise title"
   ],
   "reply": {
    "text": "{\"title\": \"Cwd tools\"}"
   }
  },
  {
   "name": "num-5",
   "when": [
    "cwdtool-num:",
    "\"tool_call_id\":\"call_num4\""
   ],
   "reply": {
    "text": "done num"
   }
  },
  {
   "name": "num-4",
   "when": [
    "cwdtool-num:",
    "\"tool_call_id\":\"call_num3\""
   ],
   "reply": {
    "tool": {
     "id": "call_num4",
     "name": "glob",
     "arguments": {
      "pattern": "*.txt"
     }
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "name": "num-3",
   "when": [
    "cwdtool-num:",
    "\"tool_call_id\":\"call_num2\""
   ],
   "reply": {
    "tool": {
     "id": "call_num3",
     "name": "write_file",
     "arguments": {
      "file_path": "{PROJECT}/w-num.txt",
      "content": "x\n"
     }
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "name": "num-2",
   "when": [
    "cwdtool-num:",
    "\"tool_call_id\":\"call_num1\""
   ],
   "reply": {
    "tool": {
     "id": "call_num2",
     "name": "read_file",
     "arguments": {
      "file_path": "{PROJECT}/seed.txt"
     }
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "name": "num-1",
   "when": [
    "cwdtool-num:"
   ],
   "reply": {
    "tool": {
     "id": "call_num1",
     "name": "bash",
     "arguments": {
      "command": "echo hi > b-num.txt; echo ran"
     }
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "name": "true-5",
   "when": [
    "cwdtool-true:",
    "\"tool_call_id\":\"call_true4\""
   ],
   "reply": {
    "text": "done true"
   }
